# Public configuration only. Never place WX_APP_SECRET or JWT_SECRET in VITE_* variables.
# Development mp-weixin falls back to http://127.0.0.1:18731/api/v1 (DevTools only).
# Release builds require an HTTPS URL; configure request/uploadFile/downloadFile domains in WeChat.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# H5 默认同源 /api/v1；Jenkins H5 构建显式固定该值。
# 小程序生产环境仍填写正式 HTTPS API 地址，两端发布分别构建。
